| 0630 | gap B — draft `UNINSTALL.md` as the R15 removal procedure | filed 2026-09-03, closed 2026-09-04: red-then-green proven, placement revised to README + `docs/uninstall.md`, sent as oscardvs/zoteus#55 |
| 0633 | not a gap-A/B/C child — a harness finding surfaced while running 0629's confirming arm: account posture cannot compose with the podman-unshare sandbox fallback | filed 2026-09-04, open |
